# The orb pulses every 210ms for 4 seconds on a 5-second cooldown, so one throw
# is 19 strikes on 8 enemies. Written as one swing of 19 lines: nothing here
# uses the gaps between them, and making it a swing charges the player the 660ms
# the throw costs. As a summon, those 19 strikes would come free while Chain
# Lightning kept going.
#
# Both numbers come from the client, not guesses: Frozen Orb is a ball skill, so
# the client gives its rate in attackDelay and its lifetime in time.
#
# It freezes nothing. GMS says the orb SLOWS what it hits, where every other ice
# skill in the book states a freeze duration, so it builds stacks and leaves
# freezing to the swings that do it.
name: "Frozen Orb"
description:
  "Create and throw a Frozen Orb that fires ice shards everywhere to deal ice "
  "damage."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_ICE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_ARCH_MAGE skill_order: 3 }
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
exceeds_master_level: true
base_delay_ms: 660
max_enemies: 8
lines: 19
cooldown_seconds: 5.0
base { skill_pct: 1.04 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.04 }
